dits all read it. The Decision Broker makes every human-in-the-loop request durable, with a deadline and a safe default, so a pending question survives restarts and never blocks unrelated subtrees. Metrics separates MEASURED values from ESTIMATED ones." style="text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#34495E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="22.0" y="66.0" width="2192.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_bg3" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3ECF8;strokeColor=#5B2C83;strokeWidth=2;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="354.0" y="136.0" width="1564.0" height="476.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_bg4" value="Event Stream · append-only log + fan-out" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#5B2C83;strokeColor=#5B2C83;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="354.0" y="153.0" width="1564.0" height="34.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_bg5" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3ECF8;strokeColor=#5B2C83;strokeWidth=2;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="354.0" y="632.0" width="1564.0" height="612.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_bg6" value="Decision Broker · durable human-in-the-loop requests" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#5B2C83;strokeColor=#5B2C83;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="354.0" y="649.0" width="1564.0" height="34.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_bg7" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3ECF8;strokeColor=#5B2C83;strokeWidth=2;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="354.0" y="1264.0" width="1564.0" height="476.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_bg8" value="Metrics &amp;amp; Monitoring" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#5B2C83;strokeColor=#5B2C83;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="354.0" y="1281.0" width="1564.0" height="34.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_bg9" value="&lt;b&gt;Notation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rounded solid box = deterministic step · Dark box with gold border = model (LLM) call, tier shown · Teal box = tool / sandbox action · Diamond = decision · Orange hexagon = human-in-the-loop (HITL) · Cylinder = memory / persistence / context operation · White pill = start / end · Red pill = stop / terminal failure · Grey dashed box = cross-module interface port (IN ◀ / OUT ▶ with interface ID)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Arrows&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dark solid = control flow · Thick blue = cross-module data payload · Dashed purple = recursion / loop-back · Dashed red = retry, failure or escalation · Green dotted = event published to the Event Stream" style="text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2631;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="1770.0" width="2252.0" height="92.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_i17" value="&lt;b&gt;IN ◀ IF-17 EventPublish&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;from all modules (via State Store outbox)&lt;br&gt;Payload: EventEnvelope&lt;br&gt;Trigger: state transition, message, tool call, usage" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#F4F6F7;strokeColor=#566573;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;fontColor=#17202A;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="241.0" width="272.0" height="82.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_ve" value="Validate envelope schema&lt;br&gt;(see Contracts page)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#5B2C83;strokeColor=#1B2631;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="378.0" y="251.0" width="196.0" height="62.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_vq" value="Valid?" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;shape=rhombus;perimeter=rhombusPerimeter;fillColor=#FFF3B0;strokeColor=#9A7D0A;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#111111;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640.0" y="238.0" width="200.0" height="88.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_dl" value="Dead-letter + emit&lt;br&gt;schema-error event" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=50;fillColor=#FDEDEC;strokeColor=#C0392B;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#78281F;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="642.0" y="387.0" width="196.0" height="62.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_ap" value="[MEM] Append: seq per run,&lt;br&gt;idempotent on event_id" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=8;fillColor=#EBDEF0;strokeColor=#6C3483;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#111111;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="906.0" y="247.0" width="196.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_rd" value="Redact for UI: secrets,&lt;br&gt;large payloads → refs" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#5B2C83;strokeColor=#1B2631;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1170.0" y="251.0" width="196.0" height="62.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_fo" value="Fan-out: UI, Metrics,&lt;br&gt;Scheduler, Decomposition" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#5B2C83;strokeColor=#1B2631;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1434.0" y="251.0" width="196.0" height="62.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_sc" value="Subscriber&lt;br&gt;connected?" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;shape=rhombus;perimeter=rhombusPerimeter;fillColor=#FFF3B0;strokeColor=#9A7D0A;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#111111;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1432.0" y="374.0" width="200.0" height="88.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_rt" value="[MEM] Retain; replay from&lt;br&gt;cursor on reconnect" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=8;fillColor=#EBDEF0;strokeColor=#6C3483;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#111111;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1170.0" y="383.0" width="196.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_dv" value="Deliver in seq order" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#5B2C83;strokeColor=#1B2631;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1698.0" y="387.0" width="196.0" height="62.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_o18" value="&lt;b&gt;OUT ▶ IF-18 EventSubscribe&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;to M1 Group Chat, Dashboard; M4; M3&lt;br&gt;Payload: ordered events + cursor&lt;br&gt;Trigger: new events / replay" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#F4F6F7;strokeColor=#566573;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;fontColor=#17202A;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1960.0" y="513.0" width="272.0" height="82.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_i03" value="&lt;b&gt;IN ◀ IF-03 DecisionRequest&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;from M2, M3, M4, M5 (any requester)&lt;br&gt;Payload: kind, question, options, default, deadline&lt;br&gt;Trigger: needs a human decision" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#F4F6F7;strokeColor=#566573;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;fontColor=#17202A;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="737.0" width="272.0" height="82.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_pp" value="[MEM] Persist pending&lt;br&gt;decision with deadline&lt;br&gt;and safe-default policy" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=8;fillColor=#EBDEF0;strokeColor=#6C3483;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#111111;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="378.0" y="743.0" width="196.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_pub" value="Publish Decision-&lt;br&gt;Requested → M1 Inbox" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#5B2C83;strokeColor=#1B2631;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="642.0" y="747.0" width="196.0" height="62.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_aw" value="Await answer or deadline&lt;br&gt;(durable timer)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#5B2C83;strokeColor=#1B2631;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="906.0" y="747.0" width="196.0" height="62.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_in" value="Answered in time?" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;shape=rhombus;perimeter=rhombusPerimeter;fillColor=#FFF3B0;strokeColor=#9A7D0A;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#111111;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="904.0" y="870.0" width="200.0" height="88.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_i04" value="&lt;b&gt;IN ◀ IF-04 DecisionResolved&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;from M1 Decision Inbox&lt;br&gt;Payload: decision_id, choice, text, user&lt;br&gt;Trigger: user answers" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#F4F6F7;strokeColor=#566573;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;fontColor=#17202A;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="873.0" width="272.0" height="82.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_va" value="Validate answer for&lt;br&gt;kind; check user" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#5B2C83;strokeColor=#1B2631;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1170.0" y="883.0" width="196.0" height="62.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_lg" value="[MEM] Record in decision&lt;br&gt;log (project memory)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=8;fillColor=#EBDEF0;strokeColor=#6C3483;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#111111;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1434.0" y="879.0" width="196.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_rt2" value="Route resolution&lt;br&gt;to requester" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#5B2C83;strokeColor=#1B2631;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1698.0" y="883.0" width="196.0" height="62.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_o04" value="&lt;b&gt;OUT ▶ IF-04 DecisionResolved&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;to original requester&lt;br&gt;Payload: decision + rationale&lt;br&gt;Trigger: resolved or default applied" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#F4F6F7;strokeColor=#566573;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;fontColor=#17202A;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1960.0" y="873.0" width="272.0" height="82.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_sd" value="Kind has a&lt;br&gt;safe default?" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;shape=rhombus;perimeter=rhombusPerimeter;fillColor=#FFF3B0;strokeColor=#9A7D0A;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#111111;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="904.0" y="1006.0" width="200.0" height="88.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_ad" value="Apply safe default (e.g.&lt;br&gt;suspend subtree); never&lt;br&gt;auto-approve risky kinds" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#5B2C83;strokeColor=#1B2631;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1170.0" y="1019.0" width="196.0" height="62.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_kp" value="Keep pending; subtree&lt;br&gt;stays SUSPENDED;&lt;br&gt;remind user" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#5B2C83;strokeColor=#1B2631;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="906.0" y="1155.0" width="196.0" height="62.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_bnote" value="&lt;b&gt;Never auto-approved&lt;/b&gt;: breaking contract, destructive tool, budget increase, scope change" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=0;fillColor=#FEF9E7;strokeColor=#B7950B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#17202A;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1432.0" y="1156.0" width="464.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_i17m" value="&lt;b&gt;IN ◀ IF-17 Usage &amp;amp; state events&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;from M5 Event Stream&lt;br&gt;Payload: tokens, latency, cost, attempts, results&lt;br&gt;Trigger: every call / transition" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#F4F6F7;strokeColor=#566573;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;fontColor=#17202A;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="1369.0" width="272.0" height="82.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_ag" value="Aggregate per run, task,&lt;br&gt;agent, provider, model" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#5B2C83;strokeColor=#1B2631;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="378.0" y="1379.0" width="196.0" height="62.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_kp2" value="KPIs: first-pass rate,&lt;br&gt;retries, cost per verified&lt;br&gt;task, context use" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#5B2C83;strokeColor=#1B2631;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="642.0" y="1379.0" width="196.0" height="62.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_ts" value="[MEM] Store time series&lt;br&gt;(downsampled)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=8;fillColor=#EBDEF0;strokeColor=#6C3483;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#111111;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="906.0" y="1375.0" width="196.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_th" value="Threshold crossed?&lt;br&gt;budget, VRAM,&lt;br&gt;retry storm" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;shape=rhombus;perimeter=rhombusPerimeter;fillColor=#FFF3B0;strokeColor=#9A7D0A;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#111111;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1168.0" y="1366.0" width="200.0" height="88.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l5b_adv" value="Build advisory:&lt;br&gt;soft (throttle) or&lt;br&gt;hard (pause run)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12